@startuml seq-federation-stub
' Context: federation
' Profile: platform
' SDD: SYS-DELIVERY (outbox federato)
' Revision: 2026-07-27

title Federation — stub outbound (target)

participant "UI" as C
participant "AccountBoundary" as AB
database "Outbox" as OB
participant "BridgeWorker" as B
participant "ReceptionGate" as GATE
participant "FederatedServer" as EXT

C -> AB : SendContent (futuro branch federato)
AB -> OB : QueueFederatedSend
AB --> C : ContentSent (sender copy ✓)

note over OB, B
  Stato attuale: outbox queued,
  nessun consumer bridge in produzione.
end note

OB --> B : FederatedSendQueued <<future>>

B -> EXT : DeliverToFederatedPeer <<future>>
EXT --> B : FederatedMessageDelivered <<future>>

B ..> AB : ReceiveFromFederatedPeer <<future inbound>>
B ..> GATE : EvaluateInboundDelivery <<future inbound>>
AB ..> AB : InboundFederatedMessageReceived <<future inbound>>

B ..> AB : ApplyFederatedAck <<future>>
AB ..> AB : FederatedAckApplied <<future>>

@enduml
